    "dialogues": [
        {
            "id": "698180201",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "Peace prevails throughout the land, and all things are made new, as buds in the Spring. This is still an auspicious era for humanity."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180202",
            "speaker": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, Xianyun! You're here after all."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180203",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "Ah, it's you two."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180204",
            "speaker": "Paimon",
            "text": "You seem like you're in a good mood... right? Y—You're not angry anymore, are you?"
        },
        {
            "id": "698180205",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "Hah. Do you believe one to be so small-minded? One has already conferred with Shenhe, and indeed, your selection has proved well-considered."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180206",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "This is Starsnatch Cliff, then? A name well-given. The wind here differs from that of Mt. Aocang, being more lively and carefree — yet it suits me still."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180207",
            "speaker": "Paimon",
            "text": "We're glad you like it! We would've felt awful if we made you spend all that effort climbing up here, only for you not to enjoy yourself..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180208",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "\"Effort\"? One soars upon the wind, and sees all for leagues around. It was but trivial to seek this place."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180209",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "And were one to begin climbing from the foot of this cliff, t'would have been but a short way up by winged foot. Hardly what one might call \"effort.\""
        },
        {
            "id": "698180210",
            "speaker": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's true. Paimon almost forgot that she's a big illuminated bird..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180211",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "What insolence! One's ears are exceedingly sharp as well, thank you."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180212",
            "speaker": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh, um... What Paimon means to say is that we're no match for your super duper adeptal powers..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180213",
            "speaker": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{M#He}{F#She} can attest to that! It was a tough climb to the summit the first time we came here..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180214",
            "speaker": "Player",
            "text": "Things weren't easy for us back then."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180215",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "Hmph. No need for such modesty. The past is past, not the present."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180216",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "One has never misjudged — or are you saying that, even with such prodigious talents as yours, scaling this cliff would not be effortless too?"
        },
        {
            "id": "698180217",
            "speaker": "Player",
            "text": "Well, when you put it like that..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180218",
            "speaker": "Paimon",
            "text": "Speaking of... Why are you alone? Paimon thought Ganyu, Shenhe, or the others might come along with you."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180219",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "Is that so strange? One's disciples all have matters they must attend to. Even Shuyu, at her age, trains hard, knowing that time is of the essence and is not to be frittered away..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180220",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "In any case, leisure such as this is most gladsome. One has always gone where one pleases, after all, and one is both pleased and at ease when alone."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180221",
            "speaker": "Paimon",
            "text": "You really are like one of those wandering heroines from the stories..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180222",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "Really now? In that case, I trust that you're familiar with this Fontainian Kamera?"
        },
        {
            "id": "698180223",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "Since I do not often travel far abroad, do take a few pictures for me, would you?"
        },
        {
            "id": "698180224",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "The Kamera has already been properly set up. You only need to stand at a distance and press the mechanism."
        },
        {
            "id": "698180225",
            "speaker": "Xianyun",
            "text": "The only question is... What pose should one strike? Any suggestions?",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "id": "698180226",
                    "text": "Strike a cool pose, like a heroine, of course!",
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "id": "698180229",
                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                            "text": "Let us do so, then. What do you think? Does one's hair remain properly coiffed?",
                            "choices": [
                                {
                                    "id": "698180230",
                                    "text": "Hold that pose, I'm going to press the shutter!",
                                    "response": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "698180231",
                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                            "text": "Indeed. One is ready."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698180238",
                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                            "text": "Are you done? Let one inspect your work... Hmm. Not bad at all."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698180239",
                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                            "text": "Good work. Now, let one take some pictures for you as well."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698180240",
                                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                                            "text": "Huh, us too?"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698180241",
                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                            "text": "From how you spoke of this place just now, it holds a significant place in your memory. Surely, you must have had many new thoughts now that you have visited it once more?"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698180242",
                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                            "text": "Why not capture the spirit of the moment, then? That way, you may relive these feelings when looking at this picture in the future."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698180243",
                                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                                            "text": "Oh, that makes total sense! Alright then, let's take some photos. Thanks a lot, Xianyun!"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698180244",
                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                            "text": "Hmm. This Kamera is rather ingenious. The image is sharp and clear..."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698180245",
                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                            "text": "Wipe the corner of your mouth, little one. We shall commence shortly."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698180246",
                                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                                            "text": "O—Oh, right, sure! Did Paimon not wipe off the biscuit crumbs from breakfast?"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698180247",
                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                            "text": "Come, then. What's on your mind as you stand by the cliff? How do you feel?",
                                            "choices": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698180248",
                                                    "text": "Very happy!",
                                                    "response": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698180250",
                                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                                            "text": "Have you decided what expression to make, then? One shall press the shutter shortly.",
                                                            "choices": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698180251",
                                                                    "text": "Alright, this'll do.",
                                                                    "response": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698180252",
                                                                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                            "text": "Yup, yup, yup! The feeling that comes to mind first is the most important!"
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698180257",
                                                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                                                            "text": "Alright. Hmm... Just as one thought it would turn out. Excellent indeed."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698180258",
                                                                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                            "text": "Oooh, Paimon wants to see!"
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698180259",
                                                                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                            "text": "Huh... Uh... You have a look.",
                                                                            "choices": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "698180260",
                                                                                    "text": "That's not exactly what I imagined...",
                                                                                    "response": [
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698180262",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                                                                            "text": "Hmm? Is something wrong?"
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698180263",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                                                                            "text": "You have traveled all over Teyvat for years on end, and in the process, even its most wondrous sights may have grown mundane. As such, it is the emotions you feel as you travel that are most precious."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698180264",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                            "text": "But the photo you had us take of you had a whole eyeful of pretty scenery! Why the change..."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698180265",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                                                                            "text": "Ah, how could these two things be comparable? One's trip was made specifically to lay eyes on mountains and water, and since it is also one's first time, capturing the scenery is but the logical choice."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698180266",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                                                                            "text": "Moreover, how would those two old fossils know where one has been without ample visual evidence? Hmph. They are not the only ones who know how to go gallivanting behind one's back."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698180267",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                                                                            "text": "Anyway, one has had great fun today. Your Travel Guide shall be followed to the letter, so do not fret."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698180268",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                                                                            "text": "Thank you for your help, in any case. Go now, and see to your own business. You need not attend me every hour of the day."
                                                                                        }
                                                                                    ]
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "698180261",
                                                                                    "text": "Where's all the scenery?"
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698180255",
                                                                    "text": "I still can't forget the times I've fallen.",
                                                                    "response": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698180256",
                                                                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                            "text": "Heh, Paimon gets you!"
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698180273",
                                                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                                                            "text": "Have you decided what expression to make, then? One shall press the shutter shortly.",
                                                                            "choices": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "698180272",
                                                                                    "text": "Alright, this'll do."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "698180253",
                                                                                    "text": "Actually, I'm pretty happy right now.",
                                                                                    "response": [
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698180254",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                            "text": "Hehe, Paimon too!"
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698180274",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                                                                            "text": "Have you decided what expression to make, then? One shall press the shutter shortly.",
                                                                                            "choices": [
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "698180272",
                                                                                                    "text": "Alright, this'll do."
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "698180255",
                                                                                                    "text": "I still can't forget the times I've fallen."
                                                                                                }
                                                                                            ]
                                                                                        }
                                                                                    ]
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698180249",
                                                    "text": "The time I fell to the bottom after running out of Stamina comes to mind...",
                                                    "response": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698180271",
                                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                                            "text": "Have you decided what expression to make, then? One shall press the shutter shortly.",
                                                            "choices": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698180272",
                                                                    "text": "Alright, this'll do."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698180253",
                                                                    "text": "Actually, I'm pretty happy right now."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "698180234",
                                    "text": "I think a relaxed pose is best.",
                                    "response": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "698180235",
                                            "speaker": "Xianyun",
                                            "text": "Had I known, I would've brought that silken scarf that Ganyu gave me... How about this then, against the wind...",
                                            "choices": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698180230",
                                                    "text": "Hold that pose, I'm going to press the shutter!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698180232",
